{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">洪永城與梁諾妍（Inez）育有一對可愛的女兒，分別是大女「Sir Face」Amber與細女「Sir Nose」Beryl。不時在社交平台分享家庭樂的洪永城，日前晒出與寶貝女的日常點滴，片中他與囡囡上演「追逐戰」玩得不亦樂乎，最後更遭姊妹倆「層層疊」壓倒！ </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ed959b7c-eea6-4eb8-9404-c134a1bdb707.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026x2Rlj5Ld4g1786501974.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ed959b7c-eea6-4eb8-9404-c134a1bdb707.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">面對姊妹倆合力「攻擊」，洪永城應接不暇，最後累到直接趴在地上「投降」，任由兩人在他的背上大玩「層層疊」，趴在地上的洪永城更流露出痛苦表情。他事後亦忍不住發文訴苦：「問阿妹想做啲咩？佢話淨系想跑。為何生女，都要咁多體力嘅？你哋啲女，有冇都係過分活力充沛？」 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b47e0e83-1f45-4824-8a2f-52ec56015020.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026JYvKdxfm8L1786501973.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b47e0e83-1f45-4824-8a2f-52ec56015020.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fd566132-2eb6-4f77-a5a3-f89d38deaf20.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026vQEBka8fnw1786501974.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fd566132-2eb6-4f77-a5a3-f89d38deaf20.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">影片曝光後，網民看完都被父女倆的爆笑互動逗樂，紛紛留言笑問：「係爸爸幫D女放電，定係D女放緊爸爸D電？」同時，也有不少人留言大讚姊妹倆精力充沛，認為她們完美遺傳了爸爸媽媽的優良運動基因！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T01:59:20.085168+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}